{"id": "tea:katharudra-upanisad:1-2", "source": "src:katharudra-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "1-2"}, "paraphrase": "He abandons water-pot, bowl, sling, stand, sandals, patched cloth, loincloth, strainer, bath-cloth, upper cloth, thread and the Vedas.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "ethical-social", "naya": null, "path": ["general"], "stage": "advanced"}, "types": ["ethics"], "concepts": ["cpt:renunciant-marks"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "low", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:katharudra-upanisad:1-rite", "source": "src:katharudra-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "1 (rite)"}, "paraphrase": "The gods ask Prajāpati about renunciation; after the rite the father removes topknot and thread and tells his son 'you are Brahman, you are the sacrifice…'; the son answers 'I am Brahman…'; relatives must not shed tears, which would harm the line, and return without looking back.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "ritual", "naya": null, "path": ["ritual"], "stage": "advanced"}, "types": ["practice", "death-dying"], "concepts": ["cpt:sannyasa-rite"], "teachers": ["tch:prajapati"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:katharudra-upanisad:17-22", "source": "src:katharudra-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "17-22"}, "paraphrase": "The five sheaths are explained and the Self is beyond them.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "analytic", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "advanced"}, "types": ["body-layers", "ultimate"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:katharudra-upanisad:37-41", "source": "src:katharudra-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "37-41"}, "paraphrase": "Consciousness is sevenfold — pure, Īśvara, jīva, the knower, the means of knowing, the known and the result; all are the one consciousness.", "tags": {"level": "ultimate", "standpoint": "absolute", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "advanced"}, "types": ["consciousness-mind", "ultimate"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:katharudra-upanisad:5-6", "source": "src:katharudra-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "5-6"}, "paraphrase": "Sexual union is eightfold — seeing, touching, play, talk, secret talk, resolve, determination and the act; the renouncer avoids all eight.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "ethical-social", "naya": null, "path": ["general"], "stage": "advanced"}, "types": ["ethics"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:katharudra-upanisad:9", "source": "src:katharudra-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "9"}, "paraphrase": "By knowledge alone, not by rites, is the Self attained.", "tags": {"level": "ultimate", "standpoint": "absolute", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "advanced"}, "types": ["karma-liberation"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "low", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
